# the abstract portraits keep their original PNG samples locally (old shoots point at them)
catalogo/paquetes/arte_abstracto_*/[0-9][0-9].png
catalogo/paquetes/arte_abstracto_*/[0-9][0-9]_*.png
!catalogo/paquetes/arte_abstracto_*/*_pose.png
